# Simple CS LNA: gate inductor, source degeneration L, drain L to VDD
# Branches at stem centers; equal interconnects; symbols off pins.
move { l } label RF_IN
r Ind Lg 10n r (gate)
pulldown{2 Res Rg 10k}
r r (mg) M:G nmos M1
to S
d d Ind Ls 1n d GND
@mg
to D
(vd)
u u Ind Ld 10n u PWR:VDD
@vd
move { u }
r r Cap Cout 1p r
label RF_OUT
